Name: octalink
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Author: OctaLink Contributors
Maintainer: OctaLink Contributors
Title: OctaLink First MVP - Visual Modeling for GNU Octave
Description: Native Qt visual block editor with local RK4 simulation and an Octave launch and model-check bridge. Requires Python 3.10+, PyQt6, numpy and matplotlib. Experimental exporters are retained from the prototype.
Depends: octave (>= 6.0.0)
License: GPLv3+
